{"id":"b0cf42030c298d08","group":"92","path":"92/92-fact-godel-sentence-pi1.md","title":"fact-godel-sentence-pi1 — Gödel Sentence is Pi 1","display":"fact-godel-sentence-pi1 — Gödel Sentence is Pi_1","type":"fact","metadata":{"type":"fact","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-fact-godel-sentence-pi1","aliases":["92-fact-godel-sentence-pi1"],"display":"fact-godel-sentence-pi1 — Gödel Sentence is Pi_1","depends_on":["[[92-df-godel-sentence]]","[[92-df-pi1-formula]]","[[92-df-provability-predicate]]","[[92-fact-provability-sigma1]]","[[92-df-consistency-statement]]","[[92-df-contradiction]]","[[92-thm-diagonal-lemma]]","[[92-lem-hbl-p4-p6]]","[[92-df-theory-set]]","[[92-df-robinson-arithmetic]]"],"source":"原书第 IX 章 pp. 107–108 的本地推论；Π1 见证取 Con_G","source_status":"本地推论；附直接见证与证明"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"fact"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-fact-godel-sentence-pi1"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-fact-godel-sentence-pi1</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"fact-godel-sentence-pi1 — Gödel Sentence is Pi_1"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b823f18a7fc28400\" href=\"?note=b823f18a7fc28400\" title=\"92-df-godel-sentence\">92-df-godel-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"140342deea557884\" href=\"?note=140342deea557884\" title=\"92-df-pi1-formula\">92-df-pi1-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e9cc91aaee998c7b\" href=\"?note=e9cc91aaee998c7b\" title=\"92-df-provability-predicate\">92-df-provability-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"076e69cbf2d46206\" href=\"?note=076e69cbf2d46206\" title=\"92-fact-provability-sigma1\">92-fact-provability-sigma1</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"68f172d58c15e75d\" href=\"?note=68f172d58c15e75d\" title=\"92-df-consistency-statement\">92-df-consistency-statement</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0dd7c9b3e61cc21b\" href=\"?note=0dd7c9b3e61cc21b\" title=\"92-df-contradiction\">92-df-contradiction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"f3fdd55235f4984e\" href=\"?note=f3fdd55235f4984e\" title=\"92-thm-diagonal-lemma\">92-thm-diagonal-lemma</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"66b904dce6adc7c4\" href=\"?note=66b904dce6adc7c4\" title=\"92-lem-hbl-p4-p6\">92-lem-hbl-p4-p6</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"975b3aa9a1e08797\" href=\"?note=975b3aa9a1e08797\" title=\"92-df-theory-set\">92-df-theory-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"468d35690d25ee42\" href=\"?note=468d35690d25ee42\" title=\"92-df-robinson-arithmetic\">92-df-robinson-arithmetic</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"原书第 IX 章 pp. 107–108 的本地推论；Π1 见证取 Con_G"},{"key":"source_status","html":"本地推论；附直接见证与证明"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GdlSent}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{GdlSent}_G\\)</span> (Gödel-sentence predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"b823f18a7fc28400\" href=\"?note=b823f18a7fc28400\" title=\"92-df-godel-sentence\">92-df-godel-sentence</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_G(v_0)\\in\\Sigma_1^G\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_G(v_0)\\in\\Sigma_1^G\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_G\\)</span> (selected Sigma-1 formula and induced <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1^G\">\\(\\Sigma_1^G\\)</span> provability formula)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_1^G\">\\(\\Pi_1^G\\)</span> (first universal level, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"140342deea557884\" href=\"?note=140342deea557884\" title=\"92-df-pi1-formula\">92-df-pi1-formula</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\">\\(Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\)</span> (固定 G 的算术强度；下述直接见证不预设复杂度保持对角化)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>这里使用<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"e9cc91aaee998c7b\" href=\"?note=e9cc91aaee998c7b\" title=\"92-df-provability-predicate\">92-df-provability-predicate</a>选定的标准 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_G\\)</span>，满足 HBL 的 P1–P3 及其 P4/P6 推论；并非任意 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span> 公式。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}godel\\text{-}sentence\\text{-}pi1}\\vdash\nQ\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\land\n\\mathrm{Prov}_G(v_0)\\in\\Sigma_1^G\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{Prov}_G(v_0)\\in\\Sigma_1^G\\land\n\\exists\\gamma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\cap\\Pi_1^G\\;\n\\mathrm{GdlSent}_G(\\gamma)\n\\right]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}godel\\text{-}sentence\\text{-}pi1}\\vdash\nQ\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\land\n\\mathrm{Prov}_G(v_0)\\in\\Sigma_1^G\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{Prov}_G(v_0)\\in\\Sigma_1^G\\land\n\\exists\\gamma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\cap\\Pi_1^G\\;\n\\mathrm{GdlSent}_G(\\gamma)\n\\right]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_G(x)\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_G(x)\\)</span>是<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1^G\">\\(\\Sigma_1^G\\)</span>公式，所以<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\mathrm{Prov}_G(x)\">\\(\\neg\\mathrm{Prov}_G(x)\\)</span>是<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_1^G\">\\(\\Pi_1^G\\)</span>公式</li>\n<li>在当前固定 PA 与 HBL 条件下，可直接选择一个<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_1^G\">\\(\\Pi_1^G\\)</span>固定点</li>\n<li>所选见证是内部一致性句；其自身的 Gödel 双条件由下述可证等价推导得到</li>\n<li>解释：&quot;对所有<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\">\\(y\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\">\\(y\\)</span>不是我的证明&quot;</li>\n<li>原来的全称断言“每个<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GdlSent}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{GdlSent}_G\\)</span>见证都属于<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_1^G\">\\(\\Pi_1^G\\)</span>”不成立：定义只要求在<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>中可证等价，而可证等价不强迫任意见证具有同一字面或纯逻辑复杂度</li>\n<li>这里断言的是存在一个规范的<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_1\">\\(\\Pi_1\\)</span>选择；其不可证性仍需相容性等不完备性假设</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Source\">[Source]</h2>\n<p>这里可用已给出的 HBL 条件选取直接的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_1\">\\(\\Pi_1\\)</span> 见证 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma=\\mathrm{Con}_G\">\\(\\gamma=\\mathrm{Con}_G\\)</span>，无需宣称一个尚未选出的对角图已经具有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span> 复杂度。\n令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box X=\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner X\\urcorner})\">\\(\\Box X=\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner X\\urcorner})\\)</span>，先用普通对角引理选一个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\vdash g\\leftrightarrow\\neg\\Box g\">\\(G\\vdash g\\leftrightarrow\\neg\\Box g\\)</span>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\vdash\\neg\\bot_G\">\\(G\\vdash\\neg\\bot_G\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\vdash g\\to(\\Box g\\to\\bot_G)\">\\(G\\vdash g\\to(\\Box g\\to\\bot_G)\\)</span>。P6 给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\vdash\\Box g\\to\\Box\\bot_G\">\\(G\\vdash\\Box g\\to\\Box\\bot_G\\)</span>，反置并用固定点得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\vdash\\mathrm{Con}_G\\to g\">\\(G\\vdash\\mathrm{Con}_G\\to g\\)</span>。另一方面 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\vdash\\bot_G\\to g\">\\(G\\vdash\\bot_G\\to g\\)</span>，P4 给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box\\bot_G\\to\\Box g\">\\(\\Box\\bot_G\\to\\Box g\\)</span>，反置得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\vdash g\\to\\mathrm{Con}_G\">\\(G\\vdash g\\to\\mathrm{Con}_G\\)</span>。因此 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\vdash g\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Con}_G\">\\(G\\vdash g\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Con}_G\\)</span>。\n再用 P4 得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\vdash\\Box g\\leftrightarrow\\Box\\mathrm{Con}_G\">\\(G\\vdash\\Box g\\leftrightarrow\\Box\\mathrm{Con}_G\\)</span>；合并双条件得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\vdash\\mathrm{Con}_G\\leftrightarrow\\neg\\Box\\mathrm{Con}_G\">\\(G\\vdash\\mathrm{Con}_G\\leftrightarrow\\neg\\Box\\mathrm{Con}_G\\)</span>。它满足本库的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GdlSent}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{GdlSent}_G\\)</span> 定义。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}_G\\)</span> 是一个闭句且为所选 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span> 可证性公式的否定，故属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_1^G\">\\(\\Pi_1^G\\)</span>。没有用普通相容性推出否定侧不可证，也没有声称所有可证等价固定点都同层。\n这一见证是原书第 IX 章 p.108 Theorem 2 的本地推论；P4/P6 的推导见<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"66b904dce6adc7c4\" href=\"?note=66b904dce6adc7c4\" title=\"92-lem-hbl-p4-p6\">92-lem-hbl-p4-p6</a>。证明在数学元层给出，不是机器核验。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Source","text":"[Source]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-godel-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"b823f18a7fc28400","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-godel-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-pi1-formula","status":"resolved","id":"140342deea557884","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-pi1-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-provability-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"e9cc91aaee998c7b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-provability-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-fact-provability-sigma1","status":"resolved","id":"076e69cbf2d46206","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-fact-provability-sigma1]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-consistency-statement","status":"resolved","id":"68f172d58c15e75d","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-consistency-statement]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-contradiction","status":"resolved","id":"0dd7c9b3e61cc21b","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-contradiction]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-thm-diagonal-lemma","status":"resolved","id":"f3fdd55235f4984e","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-thm-diagonal-lemma]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-lem-hbl-p4-p6","status":"resolved","id":"66b904dce6adc7c4","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-lem-hbl-p4-p6]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-theory-set","status":"resolved","id":"975b3aa9a1e08797","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-theory-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-robinson-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"468d35690d25ee42","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-robinson-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-godel-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"b823f18a7fc28400","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{GdlSent}_G$ (Gödel-sentence predicate, see [[92-df-godel-sentence]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-pi1-formula","status":"resolved","id":"140342deea557884","anchor":"ref-12","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Pi_1^G$ (first universal level, see [[92-df-pi1-formula]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-provability-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"e9cc91aaee998c7b","anchor":"ref-13","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"这里使用[[92-df-provability-predicate]]选定的标准 $\\mathrm{Prov}_G$，满足 HBL 的 P1–P3 及其 P4/P6 推论；并非任意 $\\Sigma_1$ 公式。","embed":false},{"target":"92-lem-hbl-p4-p6","status":"resolved","id":"66b904dce6adc7c4","anchor":"ref-14","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Source]","excerpt":"这里可用已给出的 HBL 条件选取直接的 $\\Pi_1$ 见证 $\\gamma=\\mathrm{Con}_G$，无需宣称一个尚未选出的对角图已经具有 $\\Sigma_1$ 复杂度。\n令 $\\Box X=\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner X\\urcorner})$，先用普通对角引理选一个 $g$，满足 $G\\vdash g\\leftrightarrow\\neg\\Box g$。由 $G\\vdash\\neg\\bot_G$，$G\\vdash g\\to(\\Box g\\to\\bot_G)$。P6 给 $G\\vdash\\Box g\\to\\Box\\bot_G$，反置并用固定点得到 $G\\vdash\\mathrm{Con}_G\\to g$。另一方面 $G\\vdash\\bot_G\\to g$，P4 给 $\\Box\\bot_G\\to\\Box g$，反置得 $G\\vdash g\\to\\mathrm{Con}_G$。因此 $G\\vdash g\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Con}_G$。\n再用 P4 得 $G\\vdash\\Box g\\leftrightarrow\\Box\\mathrm{Con}_G$；合并双条件得到 $G\\vdash\\mathrm{Con}_G\\leftrightarrow\\neg\\Box\\mathrm{Con}_G$。它满足本库的 $\\mathrm{GdlSent}_G$ 定义。$\\mathrm{Con}_G$ 是一个闭句且为所选 $\\Sigma_1$ 可证性公式的否定，故属于 $\\Pi_1^G$。没有用普通相容性推出否定侧不可证，也没有声称所有可证等价固定点都同层。\n这一见证是原书第 IX 章 p.108 Theorem 2 的本地推论；P4/P6 的推导见[[92-lem-hbl-p4-p6]]。证明在数学元层给出，不是机器核验。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{GdlSent}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prov}_G(v_0)\\in\\Sigma_1^G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prov}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_1^G","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi_1^G","display":false},{"tex":"Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prov}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}godel\\text{-}sentence\\text{-}pi1}\\vdash\nQ\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\land\n\\mathrm{Prov}_G(v_0)\\in\\Sigma_1^G\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{Prov}_G(v_0)\\in\\Sigma_1^G\\land\n\\exists\\gamma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\cap\\Pi_1^G\\;\n\\mathrm{GdlSent}_G(\\gamma)\n\\right]","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prov}_G(x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_1^G","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg\\mathrm{Prov}_G(x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi_1^G","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi_1^G","display":false},{"tex":"y","display":false},{"tex":"y","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GdlSent}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi_1^G","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\gamma=\\mathrm{Con}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box X=\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner X\\urcorner})","display":false},{"tex":"g","display":false},{"tex":"G\\vdash g\\leftrightarrow\\neg\\Box g","display":false},{"tex":"G\\vdash\\neg\\bot_G","display":false},{"tex":"G\\vdash g\\to(\\Box g\\to\\bot_G)","display":false},{"tex":"G\\vdash\\Box g\\to\\Box\\bot_G","display":false},{"tex":"G\\vdash\\mathrm{Con}_G\\to g","display":false},{"tex":"G\\vdash\\bot_G\\to g","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box\\bot_G\\to\\Box g","display":false},{"tex":"G\\vdash g\\to\\mathrm{Con}_G","display":false},{"tex":"G\\vdash g\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Con}_G","display":false},{"tex":"G\\vdash\\Box g\\leftrightarrow\\Box\\mathrm{Con}_G","display":false},{"tex":"G\\vdash\\mathrm{Con}_G\\leftrightarrow\\neg\\Box\\mathrm{Con}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GdlSent}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi_1^G","display":false}],"bytes":3456,"backlinks":[{"id":"235651614fd28cce","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-368","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-fact-godel-sentence-pi1]]"}],"outgoing":["b823f18a7fc28400","140342deea557884","e9cc91aaee998c7b","076e69cbf2d46206","68f172d58c15e75d","0dd7c9b3e61cc21b","f3fdd55235f4984e","66b904dce6adc7c4","975b3aa9a1e08797","468d35690d25ee42"]}